meta {
  name: Prime Capital API
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Prime Capital API — Bruno collection for all current routes.

  Setup:
  1. Start Sail: `./vendor/bin/sail up -d` (API at http://localhost/api).
  2. Migrate & seed: `./vendor/bin/sail artisan migrate --seed`.
  3. Open this folder in Bruno and select the Local environment.
  4. Run Login or Register to save a bearer token to {{token}}.

  Recommended test order:
  1. Health → Database Health
  2. Auth → Login (test@example.com / password) or Register
  3. Portfolios → Create → Show → Update → List
  4. Transactions → Create → Show → Update → List → Delete
  5. Admin → Admin Login (admin@example.com / password) → List Users

  Environment variables (Local):
  - baseUrl, token — auth
  - portfolioId — auto-set after Create Portfolio
  - transactionId — auto-set after Create Transaction
  - assetId — default 1 (requires db:seed)

  Rate limits:
  - auth: 10 req/min per IP — POST /register, POST /login
  - api: 120 req/min per user — all authenticated routes

  Routes:
  - GET    /api/health/database
  - POST   /api/register
  - POST   /api/login
  - GET    /api/me
  - POST   /api/logout
  - GET    /api/portfolios
  - POST   /api/portfolios
  - GET    /api/portfolios/{id}
  - PUT    /api/portfolios/{id}
  - DELETE /api/portfolios/{id}
  - GET    /api/portfolios/{id}/transactions
  - POST   /api/portfolios/{id}/transactions
  - GET    /api/transactions/{id}
  - PUT    /api/transactions/{id}
  - DELETE /api/transactions/{id}
  - GET    /api/admin/users (admin only)
}
